add('T01','Standing question: title sheets and page counts','The flat-cohomology cover',[(2,3)],'reading question',r'“cd^{\unsure{!|′}}_{\unsure{p|ℓ}}(k) pour k de car. p.”; “topolog. fppf”',r'title|titre|page count|pagination|SGA 4|fppf',r'''This cover carries the cohomological-dimension title and two uncertain marginal numerals, 4 and 1. Neither numeral has a securely read “pages” label, so they are recorded as numerals rather than converted into a document length.''',r'''MPL_33_002-049 §93 and MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3 provide earlier title/pagination leads only; this is the current package’s independent title witness.''',['MPL_33_002-049 §93','MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3'])
add('T02','Standing question: title sheets and page counts','The adic-object cover',[(10,2)],'reading question',r'“Généralités sur les \unsure{proobjets|protopos} -adiques....”; margin “\unsure{4p}”',r'title|titre|adic|adique|page|pagination',r'''The cover’s central noun remains uncertain between proobjets and protopos, and its marginal mark is tentatively read “4p”. Its manuscript number is 9; that number and the tentative page-count mark are distinct recorded inscriptions on the same sheet.''',r'''The supplied context’s title/pagination leads have no reading of this cover, so neither the title nor the tentative count is completed from them.''',['MPL_33_002-049 §93','MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3'])
add('T03','Standing question: title sheets and page counts','The Artin cover',[(19,2),(20,2)],'reading question',r'“Théorème de M. Artin sur cd”; margin “\unsure{3p|2p}”',r'Artin|title|titre|page|pagination',r'''Scan 019 has this title, manuscript number 18, and a count-like mark read as 3p or 2p; scan 020 starts with the plural heading “Théorèmes de M. Artin”. The uncertain count is retained without choosing a total from the number of surviving mathematical leaves.''',r'''The context’s Hua candidate locates one later leaf at scan 023 but gives no independent evidence for the cover count; the earlier title-accounting entries remain methodological leads.''',['Hua, findings register, 31-local-ring-cd-lower-bound','MPL_33_002-049 §93'])
add('T04','Standing question: title sheets and page counts','The topology-comparison and Cartan cover',[(24,2),(25,2)],'reading question',r'“Comparaison de topologies”; “Lemme de Cartan”; margin “4”',r'Cartan|topolog|titre|title|page',r'''The cover names comparison of topologies and Cartan’s lemma, carries the marginal numeral 4 and manuscript number 23, and is followed by the same lemma heading on scan 025. The marginal 4 has no securely transcribed page abbreviation, so its possible role as a leaf count remains a question.''',r'''README’s S19 programme and the MPL_33_002-049 §93 title lead are supplemented by this exact local heading and its numeral.''',['MPL_33_002-049 §93'])
add('T05','Standing question: title sheets and page counts','The miscellaneous-calculations cover',[(33,3)],'reading question',r'“Calculs divers.”; “4 p \unsure{polycop} \unsure{!|1} +3+6”',r'Calculs|title|titre|polycop|page|pagination',r'''The cover carries “Calculs divers.”, an uncertain parenthetical subtitle, and the composite count-like annotation quoted above, with manuscript number 32. The individual terms are preserved, and no single total is asserted from the uncertain punctuation or their possible association with several texts.''',r'''MPL_33_002-049 §93 and MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3 supply earlier accounting examples only; the present annotation is new documentary evidence for this package.''',['MPL_33_002-049 §93','MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3'])
add('T06','Standing question: title sheets and page counts','Independent typewritten and handwritten numerals',[(12,2),(14,2),(16,2),(18,2),(26,2),(28,2),(30,2),(32,2)],'unpursued implication',r'typed “27,28,29,30”; “\unsure{35|55}”; “8”; “9”',r'manuscript.page|pagination|page|feuille|leaf|leaves',r'''The cancelled SGA 3 leaves carry typed numerals 27 on scan 018, 28 on 016, 29 on 014, and 30 on 012, alongside another manuscript-number sequence; scan 018 preserves two occurrences of 27. The SGA 2 leaves similarly carry 35/55 on 026, 9 on 028, 8 on 030 and 9 on 032 in addition to their other numbers, so each sequence is indexed separately in the complete numeral table below.''',r'''MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3 expressly discusses earlier independent pagination sequences, and the current scans add another such documentary case without supplying a source-wide page total.''',['MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3','MPL_33_002-049 §93'])
add('T07','Standing question: title sheets and page counts','Interior headings and the ENS stationery',[(4,18),(21,9),(35,6),(39,20),(47,3),(51,3)],'unpursued implication',r'“Homomorphismes centraux des groupes de type multiplicatif”; “ÉCOLE NORMALE SUPÉRIEURE”',r'title|titre|heading|page|SGA 3|SGA 4',r'''Scan 004 carries the numbered §5 heading, scan 021 an unfinished English “Def”, and scans 035–039 repeat the Université de Paris/École normale supérieure masthead while carrying the simplicial theorems. The proposition on scan 047 and lemmas/corollaries on scan 051 are internal headings; these inscriptions are recorded alongside the five covers without promoting them to additional claimed page counts.''',r'''The title-accounting leads MPL_33_002-049 §93 and MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3 are supplemented by these exact interior witnesses, whose text is fully retained in the transcription.''',['MPL_33_002-049 §93','MPL_33_147-181+34_002-017 8.3'])
